    "title": "Food Lion Holds Grand Opening In Statesville, NC - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Shelby Team ,\n1 days ago Food Lion opened its fifth store in Statesville, North Carolina, on Jan. 18, marking more than five decades of service to the community. A ribbon-cutting ceremony was held at 7:45 a.m. at the 1909 E. Broad St. location. The first 100 customers received a mystery gift card valued up to $200 and a free reusable shopping bag. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
